From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bolt-aarch32 overlay <overlay@localhost>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 17:03:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [BOLT][ARM][JITLink] Correct A32 literal loads and support
 LDR_PC_G0

Normalize symbolic ARM literal operands to the MC label form, sign-extend decoded backward offsets, and handle subtract-zero. Add JITLink relocation decoding, emission, and signed imm12 range checks. Cover positive and negative offsets, predicate/register preservation, nonzero addends, and range boundaries.
---
 bolt/lib/Target/ARM/ARMMCPlusBuilder.cpp      | 25 ++++++++++++++++-
 bolt/test/ARM/Inputs/arm32-literal-load.s     | 25 +++++++++++++++++
 bolt/test/ARM/arm-literal-load.test           | 14 ++++++++++
 .../llvm/ExecutionEngine/JITLink/aarch32.h    | 14 +++++++++-
 .../ExecutionEngine/JITLink/ELF_aarch32.cpp   |  4 +++
 llvm/lib/ExecutionEngine/JITLink/aarch32.cpp  | 18 ++++++++++++
 .../JITLink/AArch32/ELF_ldr_pcrel_arm.s       | 28 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../JITLink/AArch32/ELF_ldr_pcrel_arm_range.s | 17 +++++++++++
 8 files changed, 143 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
